Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:48:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Compose rollout with one-pass LinDP refinement

Refine the best completed rollout order once and retain ordinary GOO,
rollout, and LinDP paths for final selection. Keep orchestration in
one entry point without multi-round or multi-order experiment modes.

Exercise all explicit methods and cover repeated execution, eager
aggregation, and a failed greedy continuation without DP fallback.
